1
00:00:00,397 --> 00:00:01,417
(Raj:)Lucy?

2
00:00:02,365 --> 00:00:04,625
(Lucy:)Hey, long time no see.

3
00:00:07,904 --> 00:00:10,734
(Raj:)You don't know me very well,
but each time you crawl out a window...

4
00:00:10,907 --> 00:00:13,537
(Raj:)...to escape my company,
it chips away at my masculinity.

5
00:00:15,412 --> 00:00:17,812
(Raj:)- I'm sorry.
- Why would you leave like that?

6
00:00:17,981 --> 00:00:20,641
(Lucy:)You were pushing me.
I didn't want to send my food back...

7
00:00:20,817 --> 00:00:22,377
(Lucy:)...and you tried to make me do it.

8
00:00:22,552 --> 00:00:25,882
(Raj:)If I upset you,
why didn't you say something?

9
00:00:26,056 --> 00:00:28,926
(Lucy:)How can I tell you I'm upset
if I can't tell the woman at Supercuts...

10
00:00:29,092 --> 00:00:30,892
(Lucy:)...that my forehead's my best feature?

11
00:00:33,029 --> 00:00:37,629
(Lucy:)- It's scary.
- Well, I like you a lot and that's scary for me.

12
00:00:37,934 --> 00:00:40,264
(Raj:)Mostly because you're a proven flight risk.

13
00:00:42,272 --> 00:00:44,572
(Lucy:)How could you like me a lot?

14
00:00:45,609 --> 00:00:49,669
Well... For one thing, you have
bigger emotional problems than I do...

15
00:00:49,846 --> 00:00:52,246
(Raj:)...and I find that very attractive in a woman.

16
00:00:54,184 --> 00:00:57,024
(Raj:)I don't know, I just...

